@*
    Says that some areas, or their statuses, could not be checked because the
    cluster did not answer, whether the Explorer is still checking again on its
    own, and offers to check again now. A polite live region, so the change is
    announced without moving focus.
*@

<div class="lt-shell-recheck" role="status" data-lt-area-recheck="@(Directory.IsRecheckScheduled ? "scheduled" : "stopped")">
    <p class="lt-shell-recheck__text">@Message</p>
    <LtButton Variant="LtButtonVariant.Outlined" OnClick="CheckAgain" data-lt-area-recheck-now="">Check again</LtButton>
</div>
